# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/).

## [2.0.0] - 2026-10-05

### Added

- Method getDefaultAllocatedFeeOnP returning the default fee reserved for P-chain transactions.
- Method getRNatProjectsAndClaimableRewards returning rNat projects together with the claimable rewards of an owner.

### Changed

- Upgraded @flarenetwork/flarejs to version 5.
- Corrected documentation of the C-chain and P-chain base fee methods.
- Stricter input validation: amounts, times and shares must be bigint values, and invalid inputs throw an error before any transaction is signed.
- FDC attestation requests that were not submitted to the network (e.g., only approved by a smart account owner) return votingRoundId equal to null.
- Integer values in FDC attestation responses that exceed the safe integer range are returned as BigInt.
- EIP-1193 wallet controller returns null when no account is connected, and passes the chain id with each transaction.
- Default start time of a P-chain delegation is 5 minutes after the current time.
- The verificationQRCode property passed to the BeforeTxSignature callback is null when the transaction could not be encoded in a QR code.
- C-chain addresses must be given in hexadecimal encoding with the 0x prefix.
- Node.js version 24 or newer is required.

### Fixed

- Fee and balance handling in P-chain delegation, smart account creation and approvals, and stake parsing.

### Removed

- FlareDrop reward methods getClaimableFlareDropReward and claimFlareDropReward, and the associated CLAIM_REWARD_FLAREDROP transaction type.


## [1.5.2] - 2026-06-23

### Changed

- Methods related to P-chain balance accepting P-chain address or public key as input.


## [1.5.1] - 2026-02-10

### Added

- Verification QR code in BeforeTxSignature data.
- Methods for Web2 Json FDC attestation requests.


## [1.5.0] - 2026-01-12

### Added

- Methods for Flare Data Connector (FDC) attestation requests (EVM transaction, payment, and address validity) and attestation verification.


## [1.4.0] - 2025-11-26

### Changed

- P-chain transaction building in relation to dynamic fees.
- Optional input parameter allocatedFeeOnP for functions transferToP and delegateOnP.


## [1.3.0] - 2025-09-26

### Added

- Add validator on P-chain.
- Method setAfterTxConfirmationCallback.

### Changed

- Fee percentage changed to delegation fee (a percentage in base points) in type Stake.
- Methods for fetching stake information.


## [1.2.1] - 2025-08-19

### Changed

- Fixed typo for IMPORT_P transaction type.


## [1.2.0] - 2025-08-07

### Added

- Native P-chain transfer.
- Reward claiming for rNat projects.
- Voting on Flare foundation proposals.
- Support for smart accounts.
- Public key recovery from a submitted transaction in EIP-1193 based wallets.

### Changed

- P-chain transaction updates.


## [1.1.0] - 2025-05-23

### Added

- Reward claiming.
- Support for common wallets.


## [1.0.0] - 2025-02-19

### Added

- Initial version.